{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id391168499"}, "name":{"label":"Fanwait4ever"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-05T08:11:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14391314193"}, "title":{"label":"No response at all"}, "content":{"label":"I have not had steps counted since the upgrade. I have contacted them here because when I went to help listing all you get is p previously asked questions!\nI do not want or need any of the extras. I need my steps counted. That’s all I need. I don’t know if it’s because I didn’t ask to pay for premium that I’m getting nothing. It says that the regular step counter is still available without charge, but it’s not working. You shouldn’t be being blackmailed into paying for services. You don’t need. I hit the trial button and it still wasn’t working so I got off. I took it out. I had to reset my watch because I didn’t know if there was something wrong that that was not reading steps. Got my watch. Reset it still is not counting steps. Please get back to me if you have any interest in working with us thank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
