{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1438230214"}, "name":{"label":"UnknownSeriesStudios"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-23T13:22:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14339806148"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t Properly Track Steps"}, "content":{"label":"Usually on days when I don’t go out I of course walk around the house when doing chores, just simply going to the bathroom, etc. But when I checked how many steps I took the whole day it said I on did 88 steps. Which is definitely not true. I don’t really recommend this app in order to track steps, it’s more like giving you an estimated amount of steps you took, not the actual amount which is a lot more than you’d expect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
