{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id22784138"}, "name":{"label":"kabrehm"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-05T06:57:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14266090468"}, "title":{"label":"Upgrades killed it"}, "content":{"label":"This was a perfect app until some recent \"upgrades.\"  It was simple but 100% reliable.  On my iPhone or my Apple Watch, all I had to do was look quickly to see my steps reliably updated in real time. \nNow the watch face doesn't consistently sync to the watch app screen or the watch  sync to the phone.\nI don't want to have to stop to load and refresh or turn off my phone to make it work.  I don't want to have to push buttons before and after I work out-  my phone came with this feature and I despise it.  I just want something easy to keep track of the steps I take throughout the day.  I have loved those app for years and this is so disappointing!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
